{
 "type": "root",
 "children": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "The "
    },
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "/library",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Model library"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " holds the models of the workspace chosen in the switcher, and shows\nhow they arrive. A model arrives as a bundle, so importing one needs no network."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Importing a model"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "importing-a-model"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": true,
   "start": 1,
   "spread": false,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "On a connected machine, fetch the model's files at the revision shown under "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Catalogue"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "In the folder that holds them, make the bundle. The page shows the exact command under "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "How to\nmake a bundle"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Bring the file to a computer that can reach the console, choose "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Import a bundle"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": " and pick it."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Give a reason, accept the model's licence and choose "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Start import"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "The upload continues while you use the rest of the console. Closing the tab stops it: open the\nimport from "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Imports"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": ", choose the same file, and it continues from where the server stopped. A\ndifferent file is refused before any of it is stored."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Then every file is checked against its published hash. Nothing is kept unless all of them match."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "If an import fails"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "if-an-import-fails"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "A failed import says why. "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Verify again"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " retries it a limited number of times. "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Discard"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " deletes\nwhat was uploaded. A workspace takes one import at a time, so a failed import must be finished or\ndiscarded before the next can start."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Retiring a model"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "retiring-a-model"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Retire"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " on a model's page takes it out of the list and stops new deployments of it. A model still\nin use cannot be retired: stop what depends on it first. Its files stay in the store and its history\nstays in the audit trail."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "The model store"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "the-model-store"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Models live in "
    },
    {
     "type": "inlineCode",
     "value": "data/models"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " under the installation's root. An import holds the bundle and the\nunpacked model at once, so the store needs room for both while it runs. "
    },
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "help:getting-started",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Backups"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "\ncarry published models."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
